scene start:
  show mary neutral at center with dissolve
  mary "A puppet is a folder of parts and a list of appearances."
  mary "Nothing here is a model: these are five flat PNGs, drawn in order."
  show mary happy with dissolve
  mary "An appearance swaps a part's picture and can hold a parameter still."
  call talk
  mary "That mouth is being pushed from a frame hook, sixty times a second."
  call quiet
  mary "A screen of the game's own can show me too, now."
  call portrait
  show mary neutral with dissolve
  mary "Released, it falls back to the pose and the idle clock."
